From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BerryMC <148406068+BerryMC@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 17:07:27 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add /tpsbar boss bar command

Port Purpur's /tpsbar (as inherited by Leaf) to 1.12.2:

- TPSBarTask keeps one boss bar per player and refreshes it every
  tpsbar.tick-interval ticks from the existing TPS sample point in the
  tick loop (no Bukkit plugin exists to own a scheduler task).
- /tpsbar [on|off|toggle] toggles the bar; permission
  dionysus.command.tpsbar.
- Config: tpsbar.enabled, tick-interval, title (<tps>/<mspt>/<ping>
  placeholders), fill-mode (TPS/MSPT), progress-color and text-color
  good/medium/low.
- MSPT comes from our own lastTickDuration measurement (1.12.2 has no
  Server#getAverageTickTime) and ping from Player.Spigot#getPing.
- 1.12.2 boss bar titles do not render legacy color codes, so the
  title stays plain text and the bar color carries the signal.

